Renovated and Furnished 3-Bedroom Apartment with Private Terrace and Barbecue | Alvalade

Discover the comfort and quality of life that comes with living in one of Lisbon's most iconic and sought-after neighbourhoods!

Carefully renovated, furnished and fully equipped, this fantastic 3-bedroom apartment combines comfort, functionality and charm, ideally located in the heart of the prestigious Alvalade neighbourhood.

A property designed for those who value convenience and a prime location, with the added benefit of a pleasant private terrace.

Property Layout:

3 bedrooms, one of which is an en-suite;

Comfortable living room;

2 full bathrooms;

Fully equipped kitchen;

Private terrace with barbecue, ideal for leisure and entertaining;

Storage room adjoining the terrace.

Comfort and Convenience:

Renovated and furnished apartment;

Air conditioning in every room;

Excellent North/South sun exposure;

Functional and carefully designed living spaces.

Prime Location – Alvalade

Located in one of Lisbon's most desirable residential areas, this apartment benefits from a neighbourhood that perfectly combines tradition, tranquillity and urban vibrancy.

Just a few minutes' walk from the metro station, with excellent public transport connections, the property is surrounded by a wide range of traditional shops, supermarkets, restaurants, schools, services and green spaces.

An ideal location for those seeking quality of life, comfort and everything they need right on their doorstep.

Rental Requirements:

2 months' rent upfront;

2 months' rent as a security deposit;

Guarantor required;

Preference for long-term rental agreements.

The information provided does not exempt prospective tenants from independent verification and should not be considered legally binding.&nbsp;

